### 7. Validation performed

Validation must distinguish between local tests, deployment checks and end-to-end testing.

### 7.1 Previously documented language/version tests

The earlier local validation reported that the updated script passed Python syntax compilation:

python -m py_compile sidecar_web.py

It also reported eight language/version checks and three local HTTP rendering tests passing.

The language/version tests covered representative French and German resources, multilingual programs, native-language names, unknown language handling and program-name filtering.

The HTTP tests covered representative searches for PsiDat French Resources, TrueTerm and Clock5, checking the returned HTML for expected language/version information.

These results support the tested language/version behaviours. They do not establish that every catalogue record is correctly classified or that all source and download paths work.

