The GitHub commit 1c0c408, titled Update software indexes and package selection, includes changes to:

sidecar_web.py

epoc16_index.json

epoc32_index.json

The Python changes include the structured source-reference display, per-item language presentation, language/version helper functions and improved ZIP package matching.
